dog-bin (command-line DNS client)

dog is a command-line DNS client, like 'dig'. It has colourful
output, understands normal command-line argument syntax, supports the
DNS-over-TLS and DNS-over-HTTPS protocols, and can emit JSON.

Since dog is difficult and annoying to build, this is a binary
repack. The binaries were actually built by the SlackBuild
maintainer, not by the dog developers, so please don't contact
them if you have issues.
